  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector study dairy Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aimed study will map the livestock dairy sector in Bangladesh, its key actors and linkages, trends, issues, challenges and business opportunities. The outcome will:(i)	Provide to-the-point details for Dutch companies and institutes active in the dairy value chain to elevate the dairy sector of Bangladesh through investments, knowledge and technology, and(ii)	provide further insight and pave ways for interventions to relevant supervisory, facilitating and regulatory bodies and key chain actors in Bangladesh.The overall purpose is to realise growth and development in the dairy sector of Bangladesh sustainably and responsibly.</narrative>
  </description>
